Proof Dungeon: The Labyrinth of Natural Deduction
Copyright (c) 2026 Takayuki Kihara

This repository contains two kinds of material, licensed differently:

  1. Software  - licensed under the MIT License (Part A below).
  2. Content   - licensed under the Creative Commons
                 Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
                 License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) (Part B below).

"Software" means the source code of the game: the HTML, CSS and JavaScript
in index.html (including the user interface, the proof checker, the
counterexample checkers, the data structures describing the stages and
their formulas) and any build or test scripts.

"Content" means the written texts created for the game, in both the
Japanese and the English versions, wherever they appear (inside index.html
or in separate files), namely:
  - the story texts: prologues, stage narration, clear texts, the ending,
    the chat log, inscriptions and the Q&A notebook;
  - the texts of the books in the in-game library.

If you modify or redistribute index.html, the Software parts are covered
by Part A and the Content parts by Part B.


